   "text": "Bitcoin traded at $64,248, down 0.97%, at 12:20 GMT on Wednesday Nov 18, 2026, against a previous close of $64,877 and a day range of $64,027 to $64,936, with the October FOMC minutes due at 19:00 GMT, a December Fed rate hike almost fully priced and the US 10-year yield above 5%.",
