   "text": "US spot Bitcoin ETFs saw $239.9 million of net outflows on Tuesday Nov 17, 2026, of which BlackRock's IBIT was $209.5 million; November's running total is $2.58 billion of net outflows, about 3.2% of the funds' $79.65 billion of net assets, with IBIT accounting for $2.25 billion or roughly 87%.",
