  {
   "text": "For the UTC day of Nov 17, 2026 Bitcoin closed at 64,947.35 USDT on Binance spot, up 0.10% on the day and down 11.99% over seven days, with a low of 63,336 USDT and daily spot turnover of 1.826 billion USDT, about 28.5% higher than the day before.",
