  {
   "text": "IBIT recorded its first positive daily inflow since Oct 30, 2026, taking in $76.5 million on Monday Nov 16, after single-day outflows of $405.3 million on Nov 2, $403 million on Nov 6 and $908.4 million across Nov 9-13.",
